d isn't allowed, and degrading comments about things like race, religion, culture, sexual orientation, gender or identity will not be tolerated.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"810099339358773\",\n          \"title\": \"Respect Everyone's Privacy\",\n          \"description\": \"Being part of this group requires mutual trust. Authentic, expressive discussions make groups great, but may also be sensitive and private. What's shared in the group should stay in the group.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"810099366025437\",\n          \"title\": \"No Promotions or Spam\",\n          \"description\": \"Give more than you take to this group. Self-promotion, spam and irrelevant links aren't allowed.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_3bd38af8-c65c-47bc-9fa5-d757d963462f\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a8-f40d-729b-bd7a-6056bb6e74da\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","group":{"platform":"facebook","id":"810067062695334","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/810067062695334","name":"College Soccer Recruiting Resources for Parents/Players","description":"This is a community of like-minded soccer parents, athletes, former college coaches and players. In we have a team of soccer college recruiting experts on hand to answer any questions that you have and are happy to help in any way possible.\nPlease keep all questions related to college soccer.\nWe will not be discussing youth soccer in general.","createdAt":"2019-03-22T23:14:38.000Z","historySummary":"Group created on March 22, 2019","privacy":{"label":"Public","description":"Anyone can see who's in the group and what they post."},"visibility":{"label":"Visible","description":"Anyone can find this group."},"categories":[],"memberCount":17937,"administratorCount":6,"moderatorCount":0,"administrators":[{"id":"100090262437936","name":"Karen Zmirak Poindex